    "body": "## Summary\n- add bounded fixed-window rate limiting for public auth POST endpoints\n- fail closed with 429 + Retry-After when limits/capacity are exceeded\n- ignore X-Forwarded-For unless explicitly trusted\n- preserve password-recovery enumeration resistance\n- add regression tests and production configuration/docs\n\n## Validation\nCI, frontend lint/build, Compose contract and runtime smokes must be green on the exact head before merge.",
